From 8392aa945cb9bfeedf722f327983691e3a40ff34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:48:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] [llvm-profgen] Support Linux kernel IP profiles

Select kernel samples using the perf relocation reference and vmlinux
identity. Drop isolated image misses and reject batches above a 1%
sample-count limit. Reuse DWARF IP attribution and report the excluded
samples and their periods.

kernel IP mode; board end-to-end validation pending
